    description: "The 7.0 AT was $934.98 on Amazon and $934 on Horizon’s store with code BLACKFRI165 on 23 November 2026, against Horizon’s everyday $1,099. We recorded $934.99 on Amazon on 13 October and $934 with a Horizon code on 14 October, so this is a fair price rather than a Black Friday low. Its Amazon listing gives 0.5 to 12 mph, a 20 by 60-inch running area with 3-zone variable response cushioning, QuickDial controls with Rapid Sync technology, built-in speakers, a USB charging port and connections to Apple Watch, iPhone and apps including Peloton, Strava and Zwift. Horizon gives 0 to 15% incline, a 325 lb rating and three years of parts cover.",
  },
  {
