        <div id="codes" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>How Horizon’s Black Friday Codes Work</h2>
<p>
            Each treadmill on Horizon’s deals page has its own code, and the code amount matches the saving
            on that model: BLACKFRI100 on the T202, BLACKFRI165 on the 7.0 AT, BLACKFRI200 on the 7.8 AT and
            BLACKFRI300 on the 7.4 AT. Horizon’s offer details on 23 November set out the rules:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Dates:</strong> purchases made from 22 to 27 November 2026 only, expiring Friday
            27 November at 11:59 pm Central time.</li>
            <li><strong>One offer per order:</strong> the codes cannot be combined with other offers, so
            stacking a second code is not expected to work.</li>
            <li><strong>No retroactive discounts:</strong> earlier purchases are excluded. If you bought a
            Horizon at the everyday price a week ago, the terms do not promise a refund of the difference,
            though it does no harm to ask within the 30-day guarantee.</li>
            <li><strong>Subject to availability:</strong> Horizon says the offers may change at any time.
            The T101 Connect was already sold out and is not on the deals page.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            Before paying, check that the basket shows the code price. If it shows the everyday price, the
            code has not applied. Take a screenshot of the deals page and the basket with the date, so you can
            raise it with Horizon if the charge is wrong.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Financing and pre-tax payment.</strong> Horizon’s home page on 23 November advertised 36
            months at 0% APR for qualifying customers, for checkouts completed between 22 November and
            5 December 2026 with a $200 minimum, through Bread Pay; its small print says rates range from 0%
            to 34.99% APR depending on credit. The site also offers HSA or FSA payment through Truemed for
            buyers who qualify. Our <a href="/are-treadmills-hsa-fsa-eligible/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">HSA and FSA guide</a> explains
            who that applies to; if you do, the tax saving can be worth more than the Black Friday code.
          </p>
        </div>

