        <!-- FAQ -->
        <section id="faq" class="ed-faq scroll-mt-24">
          <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
          <details open>
            <summary><h3>Does Horizon have Black Friday deals in 2026?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Yes. Horizon’s US store is running a Black Friday Sale for purchases from 22 to 27 November 2026, with a code for each treadmill: T202 $799 (BLACKFRI100), 7.0 AT $934 (BLACKFRI165), 7.4 AT $1,499 (BLACKFRI300) and 7.8 AT $1,799 (BLACKFRI200). The offers expire at 11:59 pm Central on 27 November.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>What is a good Black Friday price for a Horizon 7.0 AT?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              $934 to $935 or less. That is its Black Friday code price on Horizon’s store and its Amazon price on 23 November 2026, but it is also what we recorded on 13 and 14 October, so it is a fair price rather than a new low. Do not judge it against the $2,100 reference price.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Is the Horizon 7.4 AT worth it at $1,499?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              For heavier users and runners who want a 22-inch deck, yes. $1,499 is $300 under Horizon’s everyday price, with a 350 lb rating and five years of parts cover from Horizon. If you walk or jog and weigh under 300 lb, the 7.0 AT at $934 does the job for $565 less.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Is Horizon cheaper on Amazon or on Horizon’s website?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              Neither, on 23 November 2026: Amazon’s T202, 7.0 AT and 7.4 AT prices were within a dollar of Horizon’s Black Friday code prices. Horizon’s codes end on 27 November; Amazon’s price has no stated end date. Choose on delivery, returns and payment options, and buy the 7.8 AT from Horizon.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Can you combine Horizon Black Friday codes?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              No. Horizon’s offer details say the Black Friday offers cannot be combined with other offers and exclude earlier purchases. Use the code listed for the treadmill you are buying and check the basket shows the code price.
            </p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary><h3>Will Horizon treadmills be cheaper on Cyber Monday?</h3></summary>
            <p class="faq-a">
              We do not know, and Horizon had not said on 23 November. Its Black Friday codes end on 27 November; Cyber Monday is 30 November 2026. If prices change, compare them with the Black Friday prices on this page rather than with Horizon’s reference prices.
            </p>
          </details>
        </section>

        <!-- Why trust us -->
        <section id="why-trust-us" class="ed-trust not-prose">
          <h2>Why trust Treadmill Reviews USA?</h2>
          <p>
            Every recommendation is checked against the numbers that matter for a treadmill: the maker's own
            listing and manual, at least one independent source, the warranty terms and the CPSC recall
            database. Where sources disagree we say so rather than pick a number, we say plainly when a
            machine has not been tested hands-on, and we never accept payment for a placement. <a href="/editorial-standards/">Read our review process.</a>
